            if (truthy((if (truthy(.x <- (if (truthy(.x <- (if (truthy(.x <- (if (truthy(.x <- eq(b, owns))) (!truthy(alone)) else .x))) eq(elem(m, 6), neg(1)) else .x))) eq(self$nearest_gathering(r_add(r_mul(u, B), b), own), sl) else .x))) gt(r_sub(elem(m, 0), elem(mine, 0)), 0) else .x))) {
              rest <- lst(r_sub(elem(m, 0), elem(mine, 0)), r_sub(elem(m, 1), elem(mine, 1)), r_sub(elem(m, 2), elem(mine, 2)), r_sub(elem(m, 3), elem(mine, 3)), r_sub(elem(m, 4), elem(mine, 4)), r_sub(elem(m, 5), elem(mine, 5)), neg(1), 0)
              rx <- r_sub(ux, r_div(elem(m, 1), elem(m, 0)))
              ry <- r_sub(uy, r_div(elem(m, 2), elem(m, 0)))
              rd <- Fmt$hypot(rx, ry)
              along <- (if (truthy(gt(rd, 0))) r_div((r_add(r_mul((r_sub(r_div(elem(rest, 1), elem(rest, 0)), r_div(elem(mine, 1), elem(mine, 0)))), rx), r_mul((r_sub(r_div(elem(rest, 2), elem(rest, 0)), r_div(elem(mine, 2), elem(mine, 0)))), ry))), rd) else 0)
              set_at(rest, 7, Fmt$max(0, r_sub(elem(m, 7), r_mul(r_mul(r_div(r_mul(elem(rest, 0), elem(mine, 0)), elem(m, 0)), along), along))))
              .w("m", rest)
            }
            if (truthy((if (truthy(.x <- (!eq(own, NULL)))) eq(elem(m, 6), srcid) else .x))) {
              lf <- self$left_for(mine, Fmt$hypot(r_sub(ux, r_div(elem(m, 1), elem(m, 0))), r_sub(uy, r_div(elem(m, 2), elem(m, 0)))))
              .w("m", lst(r_sub(elem(m, 0), elem(lf, 0)), r_sub(elem(m, 1), elem(lf, 1)), r_sub(elem(m, 2), elem(lf, 2)), r_sub(elem(m, 3), elem(lf, 3)), r_sub(elem(m, 4), elem(lf, 4)), r_sub(elem(m, 5), elem(lf, 5)), elem(m, 6), 0))
            }
            got <- self$reads(m, x, y)
